{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/124ed21f938237374c5fb89032f6335f.poster.avif?t=1763670207\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/124ed21f938237374c5fb89032f6335f.webm?t=1763670207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/124ed21f938237374c5fb89032f6335f.mp4?t=1763670207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plot Driven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Evo, a jobless loner living in a decaying, futuristic city. Your therapist sets you up on a date with Brunilda, and it's not long before you find out that her life is in danger. You are the only person who can help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.poster.avif?t=1763670207\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.webm?t=1763670207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.mp4?t=1763670207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern third person shooter combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the Negative Agents, a horde of cybernetic creatures terrorizing Brunilda and her family. Their origin remains a mystery - but some speculate they have a connection to an alien race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.poster.avif?t=1763670207\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.webm?t=1763670207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.mp4?t=1763670207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the weirdness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal events, nightmarish hallucinations, and disturbed characters take you on an atmospheric thrill ride. Lore and backstory drip-feed through the world as you plunge toward an unknown fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.poster.avif?t=1763670207\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.webm?t=1763670207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.mp4?t=1763670207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a dying city.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-open world design allows you to drive between buildings and areas of the city. Use speed tunnels to fast track it across the world if you want avoid the THUGs and Kill-Mobiles roaming the streets.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Details:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System -\u00a0</strong>Collect Upgrade Nodes to enhance your weapons at Upgrade Benches found throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Puzzles </strong>\u2013 An additional layer of hidden puzzles will lead you to secret areas, narrative clues, and disturbing memories. Like a scavenger hunt, these puzzles can span the entire game world, and often require a deep level of attention to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environments -</strong>\u00a0Mini-games and Equipment usage keep each level fresh and interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memo &amp; Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collect memos, essential equipment, and key items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a haunting original soundtrack and voice-acted dialogue that brings the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1763670207","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1763670207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763670207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763670207","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2379320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/124ed21f938237374c5fb89032f6335f.poster.a